From 4290032cbd4e79aacfb43790cf528faac8ddd57f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gao <gao@local>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:09:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] abi: regenerate VNDK 32-bit libstagefright_foundation
 baseline

Just like the arm64 sibling, the 32-bit armv7-a-neon build re-derives
the source-based lsdump because we are now rebuilding the same C++
sources for arm (and the ELF differs slightly even when the source is
identical). The -allow-unreferenced-changes abidiff flag accepts the
EXTENDING CHANGES.
